  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TB Interventions among refugees in Eastern Africa - Eastern Africa - Multicountry Eastern Africa IGAD (01-Apr-2019-31-Mar-2022)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry Eastern Africa IGAD, Tuberculosis, Intergovernmental Authority on Development (IGAD)This program has the following goals: To contribute to ending TB  in the IGAD region. The objectives of this program are: To strengthen capacity for TB and MDR-TB diagnosis and TB (TB/HIV) service provision in the refugee camps including cross border health facilities.  To strengthen in-country and cross border collaboration of NTPs/NAPs for improved TB (and TB/HIV) service provision among refugees.  To address policy barriers and related national support to TB and MDR-TB services for refugees in the region</narrative>
  </description>
